For all your painting needs, you need the right paint sprayer. The Graco Paint Sprayer is the best and most affordable solution for any type of painting. The paint sprayer comes fully equipped with the essential components and features that you need to complete your painting project. With the different spray tips you can use different patterns.
The Graco Paint Spray Gun HD comes with everything that you need for your spraying projects. There's a 5.5 gallon pressure tank, adjustable spray pattern, heavy-duty frame and an easy-to-use spray gun for a comfortable painting experience. The paint sprayer comes with a 12 amp compressor to ensure you always have plenty of pressure. It comes equipped with a 6 mph air flow rate and a maximum pressure of 90 PSI, which can help you finish your project in half the time of with a regular air sprayer. The spray gun comes equipped with a ¾ inch spray nozzle that can shoot paint up to 20 feet.
